flowchart LR
    A[Factory workspace or appended workspace] --> B{Translate New Data?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Replace saved name with translated text]
    B -->|No| D[Keep original name]
    C --> E[Save language-specific data name]
    D --> F[Tab shows saved name]
    E --> F
    G[Change interface language] --> H[Tell the interface to update]
    H --> F
    F --> I[Stored text stays in earlier language]
